---
/**
 * Terms of Service. City-level NAP only. No street. No lead form.
 */
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const seo = {
  title: 'Terms of Service | Parcel Management Group',
  description:
    'Terms for using the Parcel Management Group website. We are a US freight broker in Ventura, CA. Call (805) 984-4114 or use chat. No lead form and no SMS opt-in.',
};
---
<Base title={seo.title} description={seo.description} canonical="/terms/">
  <section class="page-hero" aria-label="Terms of Service">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="page-body">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>Last updated September 22, 2026.</p>
      <p>These terms cover your use of this website, run by Parcel Management Group (PMG). We are a registered US freight broker in Ventura, CA 93001. Phone: <a href="tel:+18059844114">(805) 984-4114</a>. USDOT 3266041 · MC 1030328.</p>
      <p>If you use the site, these terms apply to that use. A freight booking is a separate agreement. It is set by the quote you accept, the rate confirmation, and the carrier's rules.</p>

      <h2>Using the site</h2>
      <p>You may read the pages, call us, and use the chat to ask about shipping. Do not misuse the site, try to break it, or interfere with how it runs for other people.</p>
      <p>The articles are general information. They are not a quote, a rate confirmation, or legal advice. Carrier rules change. Check with us, or with the carrier, before you rely on a blog post.</p>

      <h2>We are a broker</h2>
      <p>PMG arranges transportation. We do not own the trucks or the parcel network. The carrier that hauls the freight is responsible for the physical move under its own rules and the booking documents.</p>
      <p>A conversation by phone or chat is a way to ask for a quote. It becomes a booking only when both sides agree and the paperwork is in place.</p>

      <h2>Chat and phone</h2>
      <p>This website has no form that collects your email or phone number. It has no SMS opt-in and no text-message signup. If you call <a href="tel:+18059844114">(805) 984-4114</a>, or if you type a message in the chat, you are contacting us directly.</p>
      <p>The chat button is provided by LeadConnector. Send only what we need to help you. Please do not put sensitive information in chat that you do not need us to have.</p>
      <p>We do not sell personal information. We do not sell or buy customer lists. This site is not a marketplace for shipping inquiries.</p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>Do not use the site or the chat to send unlawful, abusive, or misleading messages. Do not pretend to be someone else.</p>

      <h2>Our content</h2>
      <p>The text, logo, and layout of this site belong to PMG unless a page says otherwise. You may share a link. You may not copy the site and present it as your own.</p>

      <h2>Limits</h2>
      <p>We work to keep the site accurate. We do not promise that every page is complete or current. To the extent the law allows, PMG is not liable for losses that come only from using the website. Freight claims follow the booking, the carrier's rules, and our agreement with you.</p>

      <h2>California</h2>
      <p>California law applies to these website terms. PMG is based in Ventura, CA 93001.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms. When we do, we change the date at the top. If you keep using the site after that, the new terms apply to the website.</p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Call <a href="tel:+18059844114">(805) 984-4114</a> or start a chat. Parcel Management Group, Ventura, CA 93001, USA. How we handle information is in our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
